Evolution Rule

The Pantheon does not seek perfect geometry.

It seeks the geometry appropriate to the current phase.

Sometimes the right move is a line.

Sometimes it is a triangle.

Sometimes it is a spiral.

The geometry is selected by the mission, not by preference.

